r":false,"text":"いつも明るく無邪気に振る舞うが、その実は大変な働き者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は陽気そのもので、後先考えず色々な問題を起こすトラブルメーカーでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"将来の夢は、お金を貯めて家族みんなでお店を開くこと。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"36072"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"36072","value":"咖啡店员"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c289c61f7cbd1646325347d87467880be44d5b857d73e0bbaae417eb773997a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/4485604721eccd65b300735a632157050c53dbc446d8c0d44bc38c1b68696774.webp","width":93,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"仲谷明香","creatorId":"vndb:s4945","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4945","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4945","name":"仲谷明香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:138202:36072:13813:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_36073","characterName":"Elise Phulie","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"36073","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"138202"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Elise Phulie","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"17歳"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祖父から引き継いだ本屋を営む女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無類の本好きで、幼いころからの本の虫。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ソフィーからは「エリーゼお姉ちゃん」となつかれており、知識の豊富な彼女は、ソフィーの良き相談役でもある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"36073"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"36073","value":"书店老板"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/703140f12383731b7dfbc7287f72cd4181d2e6530a68479c2b7f8780fc1a23fa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/090072a745f5e8e82990a12e3bf89c4a9524ab3ebaa05771263ed0d04dea2e15.webp","width":158,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大坪由佳","creatorId":"vndb:s6133","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6133","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6133","name":"大坪 由佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:138202:36073:6706:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_36074","characterName":"帕梅拉·伊碧斯","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"11436"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"138202"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"19494"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2250"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"249447"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"283338"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"310881"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41265"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41271"},{"characterId":"36074","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"41272"}]},"originalCharacterName":"帕梅拉·伊碧斯","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"工作室系列的吉祥物之一。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在不同的世界观下，身世、性格稍有不同。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"--------------------------------------------------"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A4"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最早登场是在メッテルブルグ宿屋的某房间，是在那里住了几十年的幽灵。以前那个房间因为有幽灵的传说，所以没人敢住。不过，后来尤蒂入住其中，并告诉大家帕梅拉并不是什么可怕东西的事实，于是那个房间又变得格外受欢迎了起来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A5"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"25年后，原来的幽灵房间要事先预约也变得非常困难。但随着尤蒂回到自己的时代之后，帕梅拉渐渐开始有些觉得寂寞了，表情也没有以前看起来那么快乐。她也正在寻找新的朋友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A6"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アレーキア洞窟封印龙的祭品，后来成为幽灵后住过下水道、古堡、图书馆……虽然遇见过炼金很多代主角了、经历过很多冒险了，不过总是失忆的特性使得她仍如小白一般单纯天真。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A9"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"资料馆的幽灵，以惊吓学生为乐，剧情中加入了主角维恩所在的炼金工房，曾和现任校长是同学。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拥有该作最强技能，而且使用门槛很低。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A11"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロロナが拾ったクマのヌイグルミに宿っていた幽霊。悲壮感を感じさせないおっとりとした性格で後に自分のお店「パメラ屋さん」をオーブンする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A12"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"トトリが住むアランヤ村にあるパメラ屋さんの店主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何年か前にアーランドからやって来て、気づいたら店を開いていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"のんびりぽや～っとした性格で、あまり物事を深く考えたりしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お店の管理もちゃんとできているのか、やや怪しいところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は若いが、年齢は不詳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どうやら昔のことはあまり覚えていないらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A13"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"经营量贩店，DLC可加入为战斗角色。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A17"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会のシスター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとり、ほんわかとした性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に間延びした口調でしゃべり、周囲を無意識に和ませる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会の仕事をほぼ一人で切り盛りしている他、街の子供たちを預かる託児所を開いているなど、わりと働き屋。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"街の老人に対しても子供のように接するなど、彼女の年齢は謎。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A18"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"為了修女研修，離開家鄉基爾亨‧貝爾，出來旅行的修女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但是在結束修女的培訓之後，因為買了太多土產導致盤纏都花完的關係，她不得不在萊森貝格經營店鋪工作賺錢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"總是從容不迫，也令人摸不著頭緒的個性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A19"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キルヘン・ベルでシスターを務めていた女性。今はヴェーニュ教会で、グレースとともにシスターの仕事に励んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キルヘン・ベルに戻るはずがなぜかメルヴェイユ行きの馬車に乗ってしまい、今は故郷に帰ることを目標に路銀を貯めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ぽわわんとした性格で、シスターとしての実力もある、教会でもかなりの人気者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A20"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在亚尔兹经营【帕梅拉的店】的女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为个性温和又带着轻飘飘的感觉，让她的店成为亚尔兹的观光景点之一。似乎是萝乐娜的旧识。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A21"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在库肯港初次登场。主线剧情后期，帕梅拉会作为旅行者在库肯港出现，并伴随一系列相关的支线任务。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A22"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作在王都初次登场。带着大量布丁，想把布丁推广到全世界。 机缘巧合加入了朵拉莉亚“盗贼”团，帮助盗贼团找到装满金币的宝箱分给了穷人们，盗贼团也帮助了帕梅拉推广布丁的愿望。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"36074"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/2304ac8c4bcdb34ff998c6c80281fdb7c6fa967e31baa0fc9baf2219a49d3c1e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afc34afc0557da8bf2a66c4a771137c06db970ca0d77810b85834ceeddb1208e.webp","width":187,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"谷井あすか","creatorId":"vndb:s657","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s657","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s657","name":"谷井 あすか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:138202:36074:4593:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_44578","characterName":"Logy","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44578","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"138202"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Logy","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A17　　24歳"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"街で鍛冶屋を営む青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無類の旅好きでもあり、鍛冶職人としての修行がてら世界各地を旅して回っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とても真面目で実直な性格。その腕前もあって、ロジーの鍛冶屋はなかなかの盛況となっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分が作った武器を携えた人々が、世界を見て回ってくれることを夢見ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A18　　28歳"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅を愛する凄腕鍛冶師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旅好きな鍛冶師の青年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目で実直な性格の持ち主で、以前はソフィーたちがいたキルヘン・ベルという町に住んでいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在はフルスハイムで鍛冶屋を営んでおり、町人たちからの評判も上々。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カイとは仲がよく、一緒に酒を飲む間柄。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44578"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"职业","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44578","value":"铁匠"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8bc68acc8f1998353b372f3a938b72dc45d8c078dc6ad4a016e76b07d0e6e71c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/72/7226d11fd27685c6d0cb56d43b5c9acc757ba553b376e90129604d78596a67a6.webp","width":198,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"石川界人","creatorId":"vndb:s4435","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4435","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4435","name":"石川 界人","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:138202:44578:9953:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p910","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:766","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p910","name":"ガスト","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:22855:766","source":"egs"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable","vndb-work-mapping-pending"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
